---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant DB as Vigilo DB
    participant Queue as RabbitMQ

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo coordinator once
    activate Vigilo
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Load throughput knobs and generate coordinator id
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Load database and messaging contexts

    Vigilo->>DB: Recover expired chunk leases
    DB-->>Vigilo: Recovered chunks and poison chunks failed

    loop Dispatch bounded run-shard windows
        Vigilo->>DB: Claim open run-shard cursor and enqueue chunk window
        DB-->>Vigilo: Dispatch shard window or no work
    end

    loop Finalize bounded terminal runs
        Vigilo->>DB: Claim finalizable run
        DB-->>Vigilo: Finalization claim or no work
        alt Run claimed
            Vigilo->>DB: Roll up counts, set gate, and enqueue completion event
            DB-->>Vigilo: Finalized run or no update
        end
    end

    Vigilo->>DB: Claim publishable outbox delivery rows
    DB-->>Vigilo: Joined event payload batch

    loop Bounded outbox publish concurrency
        Vigilo->>Queue: Declare durable topology and publish persistent mandatory event
        Queue-->>Vigilo: Confirmed routed publish or returned/nacked publish
        alt Publish confirmed and claim token current
            Vigilo->>DB: Mark ledger published and delete delivery row
        else Publish failed or unroutable
            Vigilo->>DB: Reschedule delivery row for retry with claim token
        else Claim token no longer current
            Vigilo->>Vigilo: Ignore stale publisher result
        end
    end

    Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    deactivate Vigilo
